  "prefLabel": "Plc 1807.03 Application for Certification Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1807.03 Application for Certification Renewal. A certificant who wishes to renew certification shall apply by complying with Plc 308.05, subject to the following:\n\n(a) No profession-specific supplement shall be required to renew a building measurer and lister certification;\n\n(b) The profession-specific supplement required by Plc 308.05(b)(2) shall be the “Assessing Professions Supplement To Universal Application For License Renewal” dated July 2025, which shall be filed by applicants for renewal of certification as a property assessor assistant, property assessor, or property assessor supervisor to provide the information and attestation required by Plc 1807.04; and\n\n(c) The fee shall be the application processing and licensing fee specified in Plc 1002.05, provided that an applicant applying to renew as active military or a military spouse shall not pay the application processing and licensing fee.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1800.html"
